{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-method-failover","title":"支付方式故障降级顺序","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-failure-recovery-experience/alternative-payment/payment-method-failover","wordCount":3099,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"支付方式故障降级顺序\">支付方式故障降级顺序</h1><p>前面两篇讨论的都是「买家视角的换方式」——他主动换，或者平台推荐他换。但有一类场景完全不同：某个支付方式或收单通道<strong>整体不可用</strong>，所有走它的交易都在失败。此时问题不是推荐，而是运维：系统的既定顺序是什么，什么时候自动触发降级，降级时流量去了哪里，恢复后又如何无损地回来。</p>\n<p>这类故障在跨境场景里比想象中频繁。本地钱包供应商宕机、某个市场的银行网络维护窗口、卡组织的区域性中断、收单机构的机房故障，都会造成单一方式在短时间内的大面积失败。没有预案的平台会在故障期间持续把流量打进坏通道，失败率飙升，且恢复后还要面对一堆散落的失败订单。</p>\n<p>这篇文档交付这套预案。它消费 <a href=\"../smart-retry/retry-channel-switch\">同渠道重试与自动切渠道</a> 产出的通道健康度信号，消费 <a href=\"alternative-method-suggest\">推荐可用本地支付方式</a> 的候选集生成逻辑（降级本质是候选集在健康度约束下收缩的结果），并把失败单交给第四章的召回链路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-降级是流量调度-不是重试\">核心概念：降级是流量调度，不是重试</h2><p>必须先划清一条界限：<strong>重试是单笔交易层面的动作，降级是流量层面的动作。</strong> 这条界限决定了它们由谁触发、依据什么信号、影响什么范围。</p>\n<p>重试由一笔交易的失败触发，只影响这笔交易，决策依据是这笔交易的四维标签。降级由<strong>一组交易的聚集性失败</strong>触发，影响的是所有会走这条通道的交易，决策依据是通道级别的统计信号。把两者混在一起会产生两类错误：用单笔失败触发降级会让通道在正常波动下被反复摘除，用降级逻辑处理单笔失败则会让个别交易的失败影响到无关的交易。</p>\n<p>判定「聚集性」需要一个统计判据。设通道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 在时间窗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 内的观测失败率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，该通道的历史基线为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，观测样本量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，一个可用的判据是二项检验的单侧显著性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∗</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>降级当且仅当 </mtext><mi>z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z = \\frac{\\hat p*c - p_c}{\\sqrt{p_c (1 - p_c) / n}} ,\\qquad \\text{降级当且仅当 } z &gt; z*{\\alpha} \\ \\wedge\\ n \\ge n\\_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5014em;vertical-align:-1.13em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.175em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.13em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降级当且仅当</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4653em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9779em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子里两个常规项承担了不同职责：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\ge n_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 保证样本量足够（样本少时的 100% 失败率没有统计意义），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z &gt; z_\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 保证偏离显著而非随机波动。两者必须同时满足，缺任一项都会导致误判——只看样本量会被常态波动触发，只看偏离会被小样本噪音触发。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>触发动作</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单笔失败</td>\n<td>四维标签</td>\n<td>重试（见第二章第一篇）</td>\n<td>单笔交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道聚集失败</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z &gt; z_\\alpha \\wedge n \\ge n_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>降级通道</td>\n<td>所有走该通道的交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通道主动通告</td>\n<td>通道提供的状态接口</td>\n<td>预降级</td>\n<td>所有走该通道的交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 回落到阈值以下且持续</td>\n<td>逐步恢复</td>\n<td>灰度放量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行值得单独强调：通道方主动通告的故障（计划维护、已知中断）应当被<strong>直接采信并预降级</strong>，而不必等到自己的流量统计出显著性。等待统计显著意味着要先损失一批交易，而在通道已经明说的情况下这是不必要的损失。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[通道健康度采集] --&gt; B{聚集失败显著?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| C[维持当前权重]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| D[按降级顺序取候选]&#10;    D --&gt; E{有可用备用通道?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[进入无备用模式&lt;br/&gt;排队+延迟重试+明确告知买家]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G[降低故障通道权重]&#10;    G --&gt; H[将新交易路由到备用通道]&#10;    H --&gt; I{备用通道是否也出现聚集失败?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[继续按顺序取下一候选]&#10;    I --&gt;|否| K[稳定运行并持续观测]&#10;    K --&gt; L{原通道是否恢复?}&#10;    L --&gt;|否| K&#10;    L --&gt;|是| M[灰度恢复: 小比例放量]&#10;    M --&gt; N{灰度成功率正常?}&#10;    N --&gt;|是| O[逐步提升比例至全量]&#10;    N --&gt;|否| G&#10;    J --&gt; P[候选耗尽 → 无备用模式]\">graph TD\n    A[通道健康度采集] --&gt; B{聚集失败显著?}\n    B --&gt;|否| C[维持当前权重]\n    B --&gt;|是| D[按降级顺序取候选]\n    D --&gt; E{有可用备用通道?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[进入无备用模式&lt;br/&gt;排队+延迟重试+明确告知买家]\n    E --&gt;|是| G[降低故障通道权重]\n    G --&gt; H[将新交易路由到备用通道]\n    H --&gt; I{备用通道是否也出现聚集失败?}\n    I --&gt;|是| J[继续按顺序取下一候选]\n    I --&gt;|否| K[稳定运行并持续观测]\n    K --&gt; L{原通道是否恢复?}\n    L --&gt;|否| K\n    L --&gt;|是| M[灰度恢复: 小比例放量]\n    M --&gt; N{灰度成功率正常?}\n    N --&gt;|是| O[逐步提升比例至全量]\n    N --&gt;|否| G\n    J --&gt; P[候选耗尽 → 无备用模式]</pre><h2 id=\"降级顺序的确定\">降级顺序的确定</h2><p>降级顺序不能是接入时的排列顺序，也不能是费率顺序，它需要由多个因子共同决定并<strong>预先固化</strong>成一份运维可读、可测试的配置。</p>\n<p><strong>第一判据是能力覆盖。</strong> 备用通道必须能处理这笔交易——支持该币种、该卡 BIN 所在国、该支付方式类型。这与 <a href=\"alternative-method-suggest\">推荐可用本地支付方式</a> 里候选集的硬过滤是同一个判定，只是这里由系统而非买家触发。不能处理这笔交易的通道无论多健康都不在降级序列里。</p>\n<p><strong>第二判据是处理能力的余量。</strong> 一个正常时期分担 10% 流量的备用通道，能否在故障时承接 100%？这需要预先确认该通道的并发上限与限额，并把这个上限写进降级配置。忽略余量会让「降级」变成「把一个通道的故障扩散成两个通道的故障」——备用通道被打垮之后，系统就真的没有任何退路了。</p>\n<p><strong>第三判据是成本与体验的可接受度。</strong> 降级期间的费率可能更高、到账可能更慢、买家可能被要求额外验证。这些是真实成本，应当在配置里被显式接受，而不是在故障发生时才由值班人员临时决定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>排序因子</th>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>是否硬约束</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>能力覆盖（币种/BIN/方式）</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>不满足直接跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发与限额余量</td>\n<td>半静态</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>需含「承接全量」的验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时健康度</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>备用通道自身不健康则跳过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>费率成本</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同等条件下排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对账复杂度</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>跨机构降级会增加对账难度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>买家体验差异</td>\n<td>静态</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需额外交互的方式排序靠后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行给出了一个常见的排序直觉：<strong>降级应优先选择对买家完全透明的通道</strong>（例如同样走卡网络、买家无需任何额外交互的另一家收单机构），其次才是需要买家改变行为的方式（例如从卡改到某个需要绑定的钱包）。原因是降级往往发生在买家毫无准备的时候，要求他做额外动作会显著提高流失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无备用模式-承认失败并保护体验\">无备用模式：承认失败并保护体验</h2><p>候选通道耗尽时，系统必须有一个明确的、被预先设计好的降级终点，而不是无限尝试或静默失败。这个终点叫无备用模式，它的要点是三点。</p>\n<p><strong>停止无效尝试。</strong> 在没有可用通道时继续向故障通道发送请求，只会加剧其载压、拉长恢复时间。正确的做法是把进入该方式的交易<strong>拦截在入口</strong>（不发起新的通道调用），并把它们标记为「暂时不可用」的失败。</p>\n<p><strong>给买家明确的、非技术性的提示与可行的替代。</strong> 此时买家看到的应该是「该支付方式暂时不可用，请选择其它方式」，并直接展示 <a href=\"alternative-method-suggest\">推荐可用本地支付方式</a> 生成的候选——注意候选集生成会自动排除不健康的方式，因此此时的候选天然就是可用的。</p>\n<p><strong>把失败单交给召回。</strong> 无备用模式下失败的单与普通失败单不同，它们的失败原因是系统性的，因此召回的时机与文案应当与普通失败区分开——但<strong>不能立刻高频触达</strong>，因为在故障未恢复期间触达只会让买家点开链接再失败一次。正确做法是把这些单挂起，等待通道恢复后再触发召回。这个挂起与恢复的调度属于 <a href=\"../abandoned-recovery/pending-payment-recover\">待支付订单挽回触达</a> 的范畴。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置</th>\n<th>无备用模式下的做法</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>新交易</td>\n<td>入口拦截，不发起通道调用</td>\n<td>避免加剧故障通道载压</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示</td>\n<td>明确告知方式不可用并给替代候选</td>\n<td>保持买家有可行路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败单</td>\n<td>挂起，等待通道恢复再召回</td>\n<td>故障期高频触达会造成二次失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监控</td>\n<td>提高告警级别，人工介入</td>\n<td>无备用是最高等级的通道事件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"恢复-为什么不能一键全量\">恢复：为什么不能一键全量</h2><p>通道恢复后的处理比降级更容易出错。最常见的错误是健康度一回到基线就立刻把权重恢复到全量，理由是「越早恢复越好」。这个做法有一个具体的技术问题：<strong>刚恢复的通道往往处于不稳定状态</strong>，其内部可能有积压的请求需要消化、缓存需要预热、下游依赖可能还在恢复中。此时立刻打入全量流量，很可能把它再次打垮，形成降级—恢复—再降级的震荡。</p>\n<p>正确做法是<strong>灰度恢复</strong>：先放一个很小的比例（例如 5%）观察一个足够长的窗口，确认成功率与延迟都回到正常后，再按阶梯（5% → 20% → 50% → 100%）提升，每一级都要求观测窗口内的关键指标正常，任何一级异常则回退到上一级。这个过程应当自动执行，但每一级的观察窗口与提升幅度要可配置，并且在多次震荡时应当自动延长观察窗口或降低第级提升幅度。</p>\n<p>还需要处理一个一致性问题：<strong>降级期间产生的交易已经走的是备用通道，其中成功与失败的记录不应与恢复后的流量混在一起统计。</strong> 通道健康度计算必须能按「路由原因」切分——区分「正常路由」与「降级路由」的流量，否则故障期间的降级流量会污染该通道的基线，使后续的显著性判据失真。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恢复阶段</th>\n<th>流量比例</th>\n<th>观察窗口</th>\n<th>异常处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>探针</td>\n<td>≤5%</td>\n<td>短窗（分钟级）</td>\n<td>回退到降级状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐步放量</td>\n<td>5→20→50%</td>\n<td>中等（10–30 分钟）</td>\n<td>回退一级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全量</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>再次降级并延长窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>震荡检测</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>计数降级次数</td>\n<td>超过阈值则延长观察窗口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"演练与文档-降级预案的最后一块\">演练与文档：降级预案的最后一块</h2><p>降级顺序表写在配置里不等于它可用。它需要被<strong>演练</strong>，因为排练过的流程才会在真实故障时被正确执行。演练的最小形式是：在测试环境或小流量环境中人为把某条通道标记为故障，观察系统是否按预期降级、备用通道的实际承接能力是否与配置相符、买家侧提示是否正确、以及恢复是否平滑。演练应当定期进行，因为通道的容量与配置会变。</p>\n<p>同时，降级事件必须被完整记录为可复盘的时间线：何时触发、依据什么信号、降级到哪条通道、期间的失败与成功笔数、何时恢复、恢复过程中是否出现震荡。这份时间线既是值班手册的更新素材，也是第四章成功率分析的输入——故障期间的失败需要在分析中被正确归因，否则会被误读为「该支付方式的商品适配性变差」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>降级是流量层面的动作，重试是单笔交易层面的动作；降级由聚集性失败的统计信号触发（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z &gt; z_\\alpha \\wedge n \\ge n_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7056em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），通道方主动通告的故障应直接采信并预降级。</li>\n<li>降级顺序由硬约束（能力覆盖、并发限额余量、备用通道自身健康度）先过滤，再按成本与体验排序；忽略余量会把一条通道的故障扩散成两条。</li>\n<li>降级应优先选择对买家完全透明的通道，需要买家额外交互的方式排序靠后，因为降级常发生在买家毫无准备时。</li>\n<li>必须预先设计无备用模式：入口拦截以避免加剧载压、给买家明确提示与可用候选、把失败单挂起等待通道恢复后再召回（见 <a href=\"../abandoned-recovery/pending-payment-recover\">待支付订单挽回触达</a>）。</li>\n<li>恢复必须灰度而非一键全量（刚恢复的通道脆弱），且健康度统计必须按「正常路由/降级路由」切分，避免降级流量污染基线。</li>\n<li>降级预案需要定期演练并记录完整时间线；演练过的流程才会在真实故障时被正确执行。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"支付方式故障降级顺序","id":"支付方式故障降级顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：降级是流量调度，不是重试","id":"核心概念-降级是流量调度-不是重试"},{"level":2,"text":"降级顺序的确定","id":"降级顺序的确定"},{"level":2,"text":"无备用模式：承认失败并保护体验","id":"无备用模式-承认失败并保护体验"},{"level":2,"text":"恢复：为什么不能一键全量","id":"恢复-为什么不能一键全量"},{"level":2,"text":"演练与文档：降级预案的最后一块","id":"演练与文档-降级预案的最后一块"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保留结账信息不重填","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-failure-recovery-experience/alternative-payment/preserve-checkout-context"},"next":{"title":"待支付订单挽回触达","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/payment-failure-recovery-experience/abandoned-recovery/pending-payment-recover"}}